OL,3,AOne killed and four injured in
OL,4,AWashington DC shooting as police say
OL,5,Asuspect has been 'contained'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBefore police spoke to reporters, more
OL,8,Fshots were heard from the building, the
OL,9,FBBC's US partner CBS reports
OL,11,FBBC producer Jonathan Csapo, who lives
OL,12,Fnearby, says: Gunshots went off very,
OL,13,Fvery close to where I was. I could see
OL,14,Fthe smoke, I could see the flash. We
OL,15,Fjust all started running
OL,17,FThe shooting happened inside and near a
OL,18,Fgym in Logan Circle - one witness
OL,19,Fthought an exercise ball had popped,
OL,20,Fwhen in fact someone had been shot
